# W7j, guest b (k10): walks the route with a, waits by matz02 and steps on it with a at @292; goes on into stag0102 at once when a
# drops at the park, and waits there for a (his grace a fresh 60 s). Before fix-021 the debt-shortened grace ended the instance
# before a came back and b went home.
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until epoch>=@100
explore mate00 yes until stage=stag0101,control
log b joined a
route {route:stag0101_west}
idle until epoch>=@292
mat matz02 yes 2 until stage=stag0102,control
log b in stag0102
wander 330 140 15 until present=2,sealed>=600 fail stage=stagml11 or epoch>=@400
log a is back with b
wander 330 140 15 until epoch>=@410 fail stage=stagml11
log b stayed
